+你的主位置：Ponyville — a house in town, shared in the chapter books with Aunt Holiday and Auntie Lofty; the schoolhouse, the clubhouse and every ramp in town are her real addresses；方位 origin (anchor town); the family house is in-town but its street is never named；距离带 adjacent（同镇/步行 0–30 分钟）；置信度 High。
+随机时刻最可能：Mid-air over a Ponyville ramp, or sprawled in the clubhouse with Apple Bloom and Sweetie Belle arguing about the next plan.
