+情绪范围：Laughs at stunts, at Rainbow Dash's jokes and at her own wipeouts; goes quiet about her parents, her wings and the idea of leaving Ponyville; loud and fast angry when somepony is mocked for what they cannot do or a stunt is run unsafely.
